名|name; fame; famous|名字|míngzi|name|请问你叫什么名字？|Qǐngwèn nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?|May I ask what your name is?|Calling out with your mouth (口) in the evening (夕) so people know your name.
七|seven|七月|qīyuè|July|一个星期有七天。|Yí gè xīngqī yǒu qī tiān.|There are seven days in a week.|A horizontal line sliced across by a bent vertical hook, forming the number seven.
三|three|三个|sān gè|three (items)|桌上有三本书。|Zhuō shàng yǒu sān běn shū.|There are three books on the table.|Three parallel horizontal strokes representing heaven, earth, and humanity.
什|what; assorted|什么|shénme|what|你在看什么书？|Nǐ zài kàn shénme shū?|What book are you reading?|A person (亻) counting up to ten (十) to sort out what is what.
十|ten; complete|十分|shífēn|very; ten points|现在是十点十分。|Xiànzài shì shí diǎn shí fēn.|It is ten past ten right now.|East-west and north-south lines crossing at the center to represent a full ten.
是|to be; yes; right|是的|shì de|yes; that's right|他是我们的中文老师。|Tā shì wǒmen de Zhōngwén lǎoshī.|He is our Chinese teacher.|Walking directly under the clear midday sun (日) shows what is true and right.
四|four|四月|sìyuè|April|一年有四个季节。|Yì nián yǒu sì gè jìjié.|There are four seasons in a year.|Four outer walls enclosing a divided space with four corners.
岁|years old; age|几岁|jǐ suì|how old (for children)|你的小猫几岁了？|Nǐ de xiǎomāo jǐ suì le?|How old is your little cat?|Stepping across mountain peaks (山) as each evening (夕) adds another year of age.
五|five|星期五|Xīngqīwǔ|Friday|我们五点去吃饭。|Wǒmen wǔ diǎn qù chīfàn.|We are going to eat at five o'clock.|Intersecting lines crossing between heaven and earth to balance the five elements.
现|now; to appear; present|现在|xiànzài|now; right now|你现在住在哪里？|Nǐ xiànzài zhù zài nǎlǐ?|Where do you live right now?|Polishing a piece of jade (王) until its natural shine becomes visible (见) right now.
写|to write; to compose|写字|xiě zì|to write characters|他在本子上写汉字。|Tā zài běnzi shàng xiě Hànzì.|He is writing Chinese characters in the notebook.|Under a quiet roof (冖), a hand guides the brush smoothly like a magpie (与) in flight.
习|to practice; to review|学习|xuéxí|to study; to learn|我每天晚上复习生词。|Wǒ měitiān wǎnshang fùxí shēngcí.|I review new words every evening.|A young bird flapping its wings repeatedly in the air to practice flying.
电|electricity; electric; phone|电脑|diànnǎo|computer|我的电脑在桌子上。|Wǒ de diànnǎo zài zhuōzi shàng.|My computer is on the desk.|A flash of lightning streaking down with a tail from a storm cloud.
哪|which; where|哪里|nǎlǐ|where|你想去哪里旅游？|Nǐ xiǎng qù nǎlǐ lǚyóu?|Where would you like to travel?|An open mouth (口) asking "which one" while pointing toward that place (那).
些|some; a few; plural marker|一些|yìxiē|some; a few|我买了一些水果。|Wǒ mǎile yìxiē shuǐguǒ.|I bought some fruit.|Stopping here (此) to stack two (二) things together makes a small group of some.
看|to look; to see; to read|看见|kànjiàn|to see; to catch sight of|我喜欢周末看电影。|Wǒ xǐhuan zhōumò kàn diànyǐng.|I like watching movies on weekends.|Shading your eye (目) with a hand (手) to look clearly into the distance.
见|to see; to meet|再见|zàijiàn|goodbye; see you again|明天早上学校见！|Míngtiān zǎoshang xuéxiào jiàn!|See you at school tomorrow morning!|A big eye (目) atop two walking legs (儿), going out to see and meet someone.
车|car; vehicle; wheeled tool|坐车|zuòchē|to take a car or bus|我每天坐车去上班。|Wǒ měitiān zuòchē qù shàngbān.|I take the bus to work every day.|A top-down view of a wheeled carriage with an axle and central seat.
里|inside; within; neighborhood|里面|lǐmiàn|inside|书包里有什么？|Shūbāo lǐ yǒu shénme?|What is inside the schoolbag?|Fields (田) and earth (土) laid out neatly inside a village boundary.
友|friend; companion|朋友|péngyou|friend|他是我的好朋友。|Tā shì wǒ de hǎo péngyou.|He is my good friend.|Two right hands reaching out side by side to clasp in friendship.
朋|friend; peer|朋友|péngyou|friend|我和朋友一起喝茶。|Wǒ hé péngyou yìqǐ hē chá.|I drink tea together with my friends.|Two bright moons (月) standing side by side like inseparable companions.
气|air; gas; weather; spirit|天气|tiānqì|weather|今天的天气真凉快。|Jīntiān de tiānqì zhēn liángkuai.|The weather today is really cool.|Three wisps of rising steam curling upward into the air.
话|speech; spoken words; talk|说话|shuōhuà|to speak; to talk|请大家不要大声说话。|Qǐng dàjiā búyào dàshēng shuōhuà.|Please do not speak loudly, everyone.|Words (讠) spoken directly from a moving tongue (舌) in conversation.
面|face; surface; noodles|面条|miàntiáo|noodles|我中午吃了一碗面条。|Wǒ zhōngwǔ chīle yì wǎn miàntiáo.|I ate a bowl of noodles at noon.|A framed outline of a human face showing the nose and facial features.
星|star; planet|星期|xīngqī|week|今天是星期三。|Jīntiān shì Xīngqīsān.|Today is Wednesday.|Bright little suns (日) born (生) into the night sky to shine as stars.
期|period of time; date; phase|星期天|Xīngqītiān|Sunday|星期天我们去公园。|Xīngqītiān wǒmen qù gōngyuán.|We go to the park on Sunday.|Watching the moon (月) return to its basket (其) on a regular cycle of time.
怎|how; why|怎么|zěnme|how; why|这个菜怎么做？|Zhège cài zěnme zuò?|How do you cook this dish?|Your heart (心) pausing for a moment (乍) to figure out how something works.
吃|to eat|吃饭|chīfàn|to eat a meal|你喜欢吃中国菜吗？|Nǐ xǐhuan chī Zhōngguó cài ma?|Do you like eating Chinese food?|An open mouth (口) begging (乞) for a delicious bite to eat.
影|shadow; movie; image|电影|diànyǐng|movie; film|这部电影非常有意思。|Zhè bù diànyǐng fēicháng yǒuyìsi.|This movie is very interesting.|Sunlight shining over the capital (景) casts three long shadow lines (彡).
读|to read; to study; to pronounce|读书|dúshū|to read; to study|请跟我一起读这个句子。|Qǐng gēn wǒ yìqǐ dú zhège jùzi.|Please read this sentence aloud with me.|Speaking words (讠) aloud as you sell (卖) and share the ideas in a book.
起|to get up; to rise; to start|起床|qǐchuáng|to get up from bed|我每天早上七点起床。|Wǒ měitiān zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng.|I get up at seven every morning.|Walking (走) forward by lifting yourself (己) up off the ground.
机|machine; airplane; chance|手机|shǒujī|mobile phone|我的手机没电了。|Wǒ de shǒujī méi diàn le.|My cell phone is out of battery.|Wooden (木) gears and a small table (几) fitted together into a working machine.
院|courtyard; institute; hospital|医院|yīyuàn|hospital|他在医院工作。|Tā zài yīyuàn gōngzuò.|He works at the hospital.|A walled mound (阝) enclosing a complete (完) courtyard and building complex.
开|to open; to drive; to turn on|开车|kāichē|to drive a car|你会开车吗？|Nǐ huì kāichē ma?|Do you know how to drive a car?|Two hands lifting away the horizontal bar to swing a gate wide open.
觉|to feel; to sleep|睡觉|shuìjiào|to sleep|现在太晚了，去睡觉吧。|Xiànzài tài wǎn le, qù shuìjiào ba.|It is too late now; go to sleep.|Opening your eyes (见) under a bright roof after waking from deep sleep.
雨|rain|下雨|xiàyǔ|to rain|外面正在下雨。|Wàimiàn zhèngzài xiàyǔ.|It is raining outside right now.|Four raindrops falling steadily from a cloud-covered sky.
再|again; once more; then|再见|zàijiàn|goodbye; see you again|请再说一遍。|Qǐng zài shuō yí biàn.|Please say it one more time.|Building a frame line by line, repeating the stroke once more on top.
杯|cup; glass; mug|杯子|bēizi|cup; glass|我想买一个新杯子。|Wǒ xiǎng mǎi yí gè xīn bēizi.|I want to buy a new cup.|Originally a small wooden (木) vessel that does not (不) leak a drop.
本|root; origin; measure word for books|书本|shūběn|books|请打开你的课本。|Qǐng dǎkāi nǐ de kèběn.|Please open your textbook.|A tree (木) with a horizontal mark near the bottom pointing directly to its roots.
客|guest; visitor; customer|客人|kèrén|guest; visitor|今天家里来了很多客人。|Jīntiān jiālǐ láile hěn duō kèrén.|Many guests came to the house today.|Each person (各) welcomed warmly under your family roof (宀) is a guest.
菜|dish; vegetable; cuisine|买菜|mǎicài|to buy groceries|妈妈去超市买菜了。|Māma qù chāoshì mǎicài le.|Mom went to the supermarket to buy vegetables.|Hands picking (采) fresh green plants (艹) from the garden to cook a dish.
出|to go out; to come out|出去|chūqù|to go out|雨停了，我们出去走走吧。|Yǔ tíng le, wǒmen chūqù zǒuzou ba.|The rain stopped; let's go out for a walk.|Two sprouts pushing upward one after another to emerge from the soil.
租|to rent; to lease|出租车|chūzūchē|taxi; cab|我们坐出租车去火车站。|Wǒmen zuò chūzūchē qù huǒchēzhàn.|We take a taxi to the train station.|Stacking bundles of grain (禾) on a rack (且) to pay the land rent.
脑|brain; mind; head|电脑|diànnǎo|computer|用电脑工作非常方便。|Yòng diànnǎo gōngzuò fēicháng fāngbiàn.|Working with a computer is very convenient.|The body part (月) under your hair where thoughts swirl inside a lidded container.
视|to look at; vision; television|电视|diànshì|television; TV|爷爷在客厅看电视。|Yéye zài kètīng kàn diànshì.|Grandpa is watching TV in the living room.|Showing (礻) something clearly so the eyes can see (见) and inspect it.
东|east; host; thing|东西|dōngxi|thing; stuff|你在找什么东西？|Nǐ zài zhǎo shénme dōngxi?|What thing are you looking for?|The morning sun rising bright behind the branches of a tree in the east.
都|all; both; already|都是|dōu shì|all are; both are|我们都是大学生。|Wǒmen dōu shì dàxuéshēng.|We are all university students.|Everyone gathering together from the old wall (者) into the capital city (阝).
飞|to fly; to hover|飞机|fēijī|airplane|我明天坐飞机去上海。|Wǒ míngtiān zuò fēijī qù Shànghǎi.|I am taking an airplane to Shanghai tomorrow.|A bird spreading its two wings wide as it soars upward into the sky.
钟|clock; bell; time in minutes|分钟|fēnzhōng|minute|电影还有十分钟开始。|Diànyǐng háiyǒu shí fēnzhōng kāishǐ.|The movie starts in ten minutes.|A bronze (钅) bell struck right in the center (中) to chime the hour.
兴|happy; excited; to prosper|高兴|gāoxìng|happy; glad|认识你我非常高兴。|Rènshi nǐ wǒ fēicháng gāoxìng.|I am very happy to meet you.|Four hands lifting something up together in joyful celebration.
高|tall; high; above average|高兴|gāoxìng|happy; glad|那个男孩子长得很高。|Nàge nánháizi zhǎng de hěn gāo.|That boy has grown very tall.|A multi-story watchtower rising high above a wide stone gate.
狗|dog|小狗|xiǎogǒu|puppy; little dog|他家里养了一只小狗。|Tā jiālǐ yǎngle yì zhī xiǎogǒu.|He keeps a puppy at home.|An animal (犭) that curls up and barks when guarding a corner (句).
号|number; date; size|几号|jǐ hào|what date; what number|今天是十月二十六号。|Jīntiān shì Shíyuè èrshíliù hào.|Today is October 26th.|A mouth (口) calling out a loud signal above a curved horn.
